  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 4404.01 Reporting and Auditing.\n\n(a) All reporting and auditing requirements for these rules shall be the same as those prescribed in Saf-C 4304.\n\n(b) All forms for these rules shall be the same as those prescribed in Saf-C 4303.04 and Saf-C 4304.01.\n\nSource. #5808, eff 4-14-94; ss by #7221, INTERIM, eff 4-14-00, EXPIRES: 8-12-00; ss by #7288, eff 5-24-00, EXPIRED: 5-24-08\n\nNew. #9377, eff 1-30-09; ss by #10021, eff 11-9-11; ss by #13038, eff 4-20-20\n\nAPPENDIX",
